        "created_at": "2015-01-23T18:19:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Like an inside joke that the established forum members get.&nbsp; I'm not saying it's a bad thing.&nbsp; It's just something that will need to be explained to new members, just like the acronyms or initialisms that we've used for certain decks, characters, and card sets.</p>",
