      {
        "id": 129040,
        "name": "twelveohone",
        "username": "twelveohone",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-23T19:00:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Huh, I guess I'm an exception, then.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I tend to see shorthand, codewords and nicknames in new gaming groups as a positive thing. It piques my interest and makes me want to learn about the new games/group. I think it makes me feel more like the game is truly loved and accepted, rather then just something folks are playing at the moment.</p>",
