      {
        "id": 129042,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-24T07:03:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>“Then an EPE was played from Omnitron’s deck” is something that can be searched for in an individual’s copy of the deck. Finding an Electro Pulse Explosive in its deck would allow someone to make the connection.</p>\n<p>Train puns, forum member dynamics, and remarks like “Damn it, Ronway!” or “Fat eyes!” involves researching what that means from subjective experience(s) in this corner of the internet that some members of this forum have never experienced at all.</p>\n<p>Of course, there is always the option of asking “What do you mean?” when either of those situations come up. I, personally, am all for cultivating a friendly atmosphere for everyone where there is no shame in asking for clarification.</p>\n<p>And, to be on topic, my group regularly refers to Chrono-Ranger as Jim.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
