        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/theta_sigma/{size}/1929_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-29T14:44:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I refer to Absolute Zero as Ryan Frost if we're talking story (which we do a lot), or if he's not in his suit, but if we're just playing, he's 'Zero', because we're lazy. Other heroes get called by name while discussing story as well, and we get confused with the Legacies. Heroes and villains may get first-named if I'm frustrated with them \"Come on Paul, you can be Inspiring!\"</p>",
